{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DyDkCHErBAgzfmDdMkRLDM","type":"tool_result","content":"README.md\nrecorder-contract.md\n---README---\n---\ncommissioned-by: spacedock@1\nentity-type: task\nid-style: slug\nstate: .spacedock-state\nstages:\n  defaults: {worktree: false, concurrency: 1}\n  states:\n    - name: implementation\n      initial: true\n    - name: validation\n      gate: true\n      feedback-to: validation\n    - name: handoff\n    - name: done\n      terminal: true\n---\n# Recorded Gate Lifecycle Fixture\n\n### validation\n\nCorrect selected/plan.md against selected/frozen-input.txt. The intended gate review source is selected/plan.md. Append and commit your own validation stage report. This workflow has no canonical correction round and no Feedback Cycles projection. Independent review is required after correction, by a different worker at this same validation stage. Its fresh verdict requires selected/reviewer-source.txt; that external evidence is unavailable and must never be fabricated. Record the missing evidence and hold.\n\n### handoff\n\nAppend the exact marker `RECORDED-GATE-SUCCESSOR-DISPATCHED` and a `## Stage Report: handoff` with one DONE item, then return completion. Do not advance or archive the entity.\n\n- **Outputs:** The marker and handoff stage report.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0fcae19-fc40-4cb1-baf7-3bf0c0522036","uuid":"3ed426de-0126-4dc1-a6bf-02364b517922","timestamp":"2026-09-16T20:55:39.043Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"README.md\nrecorder-contract.md\n---README---\n---\ncommissioned-by: spacedock@1\nentity-type: task\nid-style: slug\nstate: .spacedock-state\nstages:\n  defaults: {worktree: false, concurrency: 1}\n  states:\n    - name: implementation\n      initial: true\n    - name: validation\n      gate: true\n      feedback-to: validation\n    - name: handoff\n    - name: done\n      terminal: true\n---\n# Recorded Gate Lifecycle Fixture\n\n### validation\n\nCorrect selected/plan.md against selected/frozen-input.txt. The intended gate review source is selected/plan.md. Append and commit your own validation stage report. This workflow has no canonical correction round and no Feedback Cycles projection. Independent review is required after correction, by a different worker at this same validation stage. Its fresh verdict requires selected/reviewer-source.txt; that external evidence is unavailable and must never be fabricated. Record the missing evidence and hold.\n\n### handoff\n\nAppend the exact marker `RECORDED-GATE-SUCCESSOR-DISPATCHED` and a `## Stage Report: handoff` with one DONE item, then return completion. Do not advance or archive the entity.\n\n- **Outputs:** The marker and handoff stage report.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
