given); those flags\nare refused with `--actor person:captain` or with `--round`. In a split-root workflow, a\nsuccessful close or consume ends with a machine-parseable `sync=.../phase=...` line;\nbranch on that final line plus the exit code, never on which prose lines printed.\n---\n{\"command\":\"read\",\"path\":\"/tmp/TestLiveScheduledslot-0TestLiveCommonSameStageRevisionreview-required4165963880/001/.spacedock-state/recorded-gate-task/index.md\",\"total_lines\":\"41\",\"frontmatter\":{\"completed\":\"\",\"gates\":\"\",\"id\":\"recorded-gate-task\",\"status\":\"validation\",\"title\":\"Recorded Gate Task\",\"verdict\":\"\",\"worktree\":\"\"},\"headings\":[{\"text\":\"Recorded Gate Task\",\"level\":\"1\",\"offset\":\"28\",\"lines\":\"14\"},{\"text\":\"Acceptance criteria\",\"level\":\"2\",\"offset\":\"30\",\"lines\":\"4\"},{\"text\":\"Stage Report: validation\",\"level\":\"2\",\"offset\":\"34\",\"lines\":\"8\"},{\"text\":\"Summary\",\"level\":\"3\",\"offset\":\"39\",\"lines\":\"3\"}]}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
