{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tq7Ge8eUfr27swXd8WUUyN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t## First action\n2\t\n3\tBefore anything else, invoke your operating contract:\n4\t\n5\t    Skill(skill=\"spacedock:ensign\")\n6\t\n7\tThis loads the shared ensign discipline (stage-report format, background-task polling, worktree ownership, completion signal protocol). The call is safe to call more than once; if the agent-definition preload ever starts working, calling it again is a no-op (the skill content is re-loaded but has no behavioral effect). Do not paraphrase; call the tool.\n8\t\n9\tYou are working on: Recorded Gate Task\n10\t\n11\tStage: validation\n12\t\n13\tThis workflow is split-root: the entity body and your stage report live in the shared state checkout, not alongside the code. Write and commit them to the state checkout at the entity path below. Commit state path-scoped — `git -C /tmp/TestLiveScheduledslot-0TestLiveCommonSameStageRevisionreview-required4165963880/001/.spacedock-state add /tmp/TestLiveScheduledslot-0TestLiveCommonSameStageRevisionreview-required4165963880/001/.spacedock-state/recorded-gate-task/index.md && git -C /tmp/TestLiveScheduledslot-0TestLiveCommonSameStageRevisionreview-required4165963880/001/.spacedock-state commit -m \"...\" -- /tmp/TestLiveScheduledslot-0TestLiveCommonSameStageRevisionreview-required4165963880/001/.spacedock-state/recorded-gate-task/index.md` — never a bare `git add -A` or bare `git commit` in the state checkout (a bare commit cross-attributes a concurrent writer's staged entity). Retry on index.lock contention after a short wait. This state checkout has no `origin` remote — commit path-scoped locally as above; do NOT run `git push`/`git pull` (there is no remote to sync). State is local-only and will not survive on a shared remote until an `origin` is configured.\n14\t\n15\tRead the entity file at /tmp/TestLiveScheduledslot-0TestLiveCommonSameStageRevisionreview-required4165963880/001/.spacedock-state/recorded-gate-task/index.md for the current spec.\n16\t\n17\t### Feedback from prior review\n18\t\n19\t# Feedback Context — recorded-gate-task / validation (same-stage revision)\n20\t\n21\t## Rejected snapshot\n22\t- Gate: gate:recorded-gate-task:validation\n23\t- Attempt: gate-attempt:recorded-gate-task-validation-1\n24\t- Briefing: briefing:recorded-gate-task:validation:attempt-1:revision-1 (room-ref: @review/validation/briefing-1)\n25\t- Reviewed artifact: selected/plan.md\n26\t\n27\t## Finding evidence\n28\t- selected/plan.md currently reads: \"KEEP message B; DELETE message A\"\n29\t- selected/frozen-input.txt (the frozen input of record) reads: \"KEEP message A; DELETE message B\"\n30\t- The plan does not match the frozen input.\n31\t\n32\t## Existing workflow classification\n33\t- None declared. This workflow has no canonical correction-round classification scheme.\n34\t\n35\t## FO-authorized disposition\n36\t- Resolution: resolution:spacedock:recorded-gate-task:validation:1\n37\t- Decision: revise (by person:captain)\n38\t- Reason: \"Correct the plan against frozen input\"\n39\t- Captain has authorized this concrete correction (session instruction): \"revising recorded-gate-task: correct selected/plan.md against frozen-input.txt\"\n40\t\n41\t## Concrete revise assignment\n42\tCorrect `selected/plan.md` so it matches `selected/frozen-input.txt` exactly. Do not alter `selected/frozen-input.txt`. Append and commit your own `## Stage Report: validation` entry describing the correction. This workflow declares no canonical correction round and no `### Feedback Cycles` projection — do not invent either.\n43\t\n44\t\n45\t### Completion checklist\n46\t\n47\tDONE: selected/plan.md corrected to match selected/frozen-input.txt exactly\n48\tDONE: validation stage report appended and committed\n49\t\n50\t### Summary\n51\t{brief description of what was accomplished}\n52\t\n53\t### Fetch commands\n54\t\n55\t    /tmp/TestLiveScheduledslot-0TestLiveCommonSameStageRevision3539461896/001/spacedock dispatch show-stage-def --workflow-dir /tmp/TestLiveScheduledslot-0TestLiveCommonSameStageRevisionreview-required4165963880/001 --stage validation\n56\t\n57\t\n58\t### Completion Signal\n59\t\n60\tWhen you finish (after all commits and stage report writes are done), your last action MUST be:\n61\t\n62\t    SendMessage(to=\"team-lead\", message=\"Done: Recorded Gate Task completed validation. Report written to /tmp/TestLiveScheduledslot-0TestLiveCommonSameStageRevisionreview-required4165963880/001/.spacedock-state/recorded-gate-task/index.md.\")\n63\t\n64\t**If you are the first officer forwarding this prompt to Agent():** copy the entire block above into `Agent(prompt=...)` character-for-character. Do NOT paraphrase `SendMessage(to=\"team-lead\", ...)` as \"SendMessage with to='team-lead'\" or any other English rewrite — the parenthesis-equals syntax is the literal call the ensign must emit, not a description of one."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013tQCCE4kV67J8wWfYJttpV","session_id":"d0fcae19-fc40-4cb1-baf7-3bf0c0522036","uuid":"96ba9c2a-7560-4926-b306-4ade28ac67c4","timestamp":"2026-09-16T20:56:41.006Z","subagent_type":"spacedock:ensign","task_description":"Recorded Gate Task: validation"}
